ATP is a specification + docs repo (Markdown spec, README, examples, JSON Schemas, conformance shell scripts, Python check scripts). No application code and no build. The only unit test suite is scripts/test_checks.py, the unit tests for the check scripts (run: python3 scripts/test_checks.py); the conformance test suite (conformance/level1.sh, conformance/level2.sh) tests a running authority. The standard 8-phase CI gate is not applicable.
